BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:OCAD University Senate Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260928T151500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260928T181500
UID:ocad-university-senate-meeting-19@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:OCAD University Senate Meeting\n\nThe next regular meeting of 
 the OCAD University Senate is scheduled to take place on Monday\, Septembe
 r 28\, 2026 from 3:15 pm – 6:15 pm EDT. The Senate is responsible for th
 e establishment and regulation of academic policy\, standards and procedur
 es at OCAD University. The Senate and its many committees are in charge of
  all matters pertaining to OCAD U academic resources\, academic programmin
 g\, academic strategic planning\, student affairs and any other such matte
 rs relating to academic issues. More information can be found on the OCAD 
 U Senate webpage . If you would like to attend as a guest\, or if you have
  any questions\, please contact David Wagschal\, Quality Assurance Officer
  & Associate Senate Secretary at dwagschal@ocadu.ca.
URL:https://www.ocadu.ca/events-and-exhibitions/ocad-university-senate-mee
 ting-19
X-SOURCE:OCAD University
END:VEVENT
