 ties Navigate the OCAD U campus before classes begin Free swag bags! You'l
 l learn about the supports available to you\, learning strategies\, tips a
 nd guidance from upper-year students\, instructors and support services. Y
 ou'll get to meet others in your program\, make some new friends\, partici
 pate in fun activities and learn how to navigate the campus before classes
  begin in the fall. Lunch is provided daily. Please register using this li
 nk \, by August 10\, 2026 Questions? Contact sas@ocadu.ca .
