BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:One-on-One Career Mentorship with Chung Leung
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260521T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260724T130000
UID:one-one-career-mentorship-chung-leung@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:Looking for some feedback on your work\, career path\, or life
  after OCAD U? The OCAD U Creative Professionals-In-Residence program is a
  mentorship initiative created to support the career success of current OC
 AD U students and recent alumni. Book a one-on-one career mentorship sessi
 on with our guests this semester and receive career advising\, feedback on
  your portfolio and hear their professional insights.\n\nIntroducing our S
 ummer 2026 Creative Professional-in-Residence\, Chung Leung (Senior Graphi
 c Designer at FORREC Ltd. )! Looking for some feedback on your work\, care
 er path\, or life after OCAD U? The OCAD U Creative Professionals-In-Resid
 ence program is a mentorship initiative created to support the career succ
 ess of current OCAD U students and recent alumni. Book a one-on-one career
  mentorship session with our guest this semester and receive career advisi
 ng\, feedback on your portfolio and hear their professional insights. Chun
 g Leung is an environmental graphic designer with a Bachelor of Design (BD
 es) in Graphic Design from OCAD University. Her work blends graphic design
  and wayfinding into physical spaces\; spanning large-scale entertainment 
 and destination environments around the world\, with projects for brands l
 ike The Simpsons\, LEGOLAND\, and beyond. She is currently a Senior Design
 er at FORREC Ltd. and has previously held roles at SimEx-Iwerks and Forge 
 Media + Design. Additionally\, Chung is the founder of Unmatchable Jewelle
 ry Inc. \, is passionate about storytelling and public speaking - having s
 pent ten years at Toastmasters - and is a mentor to emerging designers acr
 oss Toronto. One-on-One Career Mentorship with Chung Leung - Senior Graphi
 c Designer at FORREC Ltd. You can book an in-person or virtual mentorship 
 session with Chung from May 21 - July 24\, 2026. Click here to book a sess
 ion today!
LOCATION:Rosalie Sharp Pavillion (MCD) 115 McCaul St. Level 3
URL:https://doodle.com/meeting/participate/id/elkl2yJd
X-SOURCE:OCAD University
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
